### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@rootUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminEmail = admin@alltectamil.com
@adminPassword = Admin@123
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ==========================================
### PUBLIC ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 1. Root Welcome Route
GET {{rootUrl}}/
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Welcome to AllTechTamil Blogger API",
#   "version": "1.0.0",
#   "documentation": "/api/health"
# }

