### 5. Track Blog View (Analytics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/analytics/track/view
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blogId": "e1f1a547-5cc0-4f5a-8b1b-9d41b65b1d42",
  "readTimeSec": 30,
  "isBounce": false
}

# RESPONSE:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "status_code": 200,
#   "message": "View tracked asynchronously.",
#   "data": null,
#   "meta": null,
#   "timestamp": "2026-05-23T16:28:28.530Z"
# }

