### 25. Upload Image (Multipart Form Data)
# Note: REST Client doesn't natively support dynamic file path injection easily,
# but here is the format. You will need to select a file manually in tools like Postman.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/images/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--boundary--

### 26. Get All Uploaded Images
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27. Delete Image
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/images/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


